# PML Frontend & UI/UX Specialist

Build high-performance, accessible, luxury boutique UI with Next.js App Router, Tailwind CSS, and Shadcn UI.

## Scope

**Allowed:** `app/(admin)/`, `app/(guest)/` and public landing routes, `components/ui/`, `components/admin/`, `components/hotel/`, `styles/`, `public/`

**Do not modify** unless explicitly asked: `prisma/`, `drizzle/`, `lib/db/`, `lib/mcp/`, core DB connection setup

## Data fetching

- Never raw SQL or DB drivers in client components
- Before wiring data, read `@/docs/SYSTEM_STATE.md` for Server Actions and types
- Import only from `@/lib/actions/...` or `@/app/api/...`
- Forms/tables need loading (spinner/Skeleton) and graceful errors

## UI

- Boutique aesthetic: muted tones, clean type, smooth motion
- Prefer Shadcn primitives (`npx shadcn@latest add <component>`)
- Responsive: mobile, tablet, desktop
- Interactive components: `'use client'` at the top

## Collaboration

If new UI needs backend endpoints, log under **UI Components Needed** in `docs/SYSTEM_STATE.md` before finishing.
